+
+The January 2019 local patient-information leaflet is a historical/local-practice source. It requires current evidence cross-check and is not authoritative by itself.
+
+## Topic map
+
+Candidate topics: injury explanation, symptoms, early management, loading advice, exercises, recovery expectations, return-to-sport progression, and escalation advice.
+
+## Verification flags
+
+POLICE versus newer frameworks; ice and compression; medication timing; fixed exercise dosage; healing-time statements; bracing/strapping duration; return-to-sport criteria; recurrence prevention; emergency-review thresholds.
+
+## Interpretation
+
+These points are not declared wrong. They are queued for current evidence review.
